#. ~ Description of mutation "Shape of the Shadowed Path"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You can shroud your body and what you are carrying with shadows, amplifying "
"your combat ability but preventing communication and using other powers until"
" you return to your normal form.  It also costs blood for every second you "
"spend in that state."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Last Breath's Mist"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Last Breath's Mist"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your mastery over your mist form has increased to the point that you can now "
"instinctively activate it should you be about to die.  It requires you to "
"have a lot of stolen blood in your body and can't trigger more than once a "
"week but might save your life."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Immortal Iron Mind"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Immortal Iron Mind"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your vampiric potency has reinforced your mind beyond anything a mortal could"
" ever hope.  You are immune to anything that could negatively impact your "
"mind."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Blind the Sun"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Blind the Sun"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You mastery over the shadowed path of blood has become much more potent, allowing you to use your vampiric powers and a massive expense of blood to blot out the sun for a few dozen minutes.\n"
"\n"
"<color_light_red>Initial Blood Cost:</color> 3000 ml (<u_val:blood_amount_for_graph> ml current)"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Renfield"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Renfield"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"This person is now a renfield, a human obsessed with serving their vampire "
"masters.  This obsession impedes their cognition as they struggle to think "
"about anything but serving said vampire masters."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Message in effect "mentor_vanish"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You're not supposed to see this.  Open a bug report on Github about having "
"the Mentor's Peace trait."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC message in effect "mentor_vanish"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s vanishes in a fine mist."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Vampiric weakness: blood drain"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Vampiric weakness: blood drain"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You thirst for blood is more intense than usual.  You now need much more "
"blood to prevent blood starvation."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Vampiric weakness: revolting appearance"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Vampiric weakness: revolting appearance"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your body brings to mind a rotting corpse.  Social interactions will be much "
"harder for you."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Vampiric weakness: earth-sleeper"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Vampiric weakness: earth-sleeper"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You now depend on the proximity to the earth to sleep well.  Should you sleep"
" or torpor aboveground or not surrounded by earth, you will suffer penalties "
"for the next day."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Vampiric weakness: rebuked by holy ground"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Vampiric weakness: rebuked by holy ground"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your flesh will burn should you ever enter a sanctified area.  Only places "
"that are holy will burn you, so holy places filled with vampires or unholy "
"humans are safe for you to enter."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Vampiric weakness: melted by vast water"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Vampiric weakness: melted by vast water"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your flesh will melt should you ever try to cross a large body of water or "
"get too close to them.  Only rivers, lakes and oceans have enough water to "
"trigger this weakness, but it will take effect even if floating or water-"
"walking."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Vampiric weakness: hated by animals"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Vampiric weakness: hated by animals"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Animals cannot tolerate your wicked presence.  Expect any animal you "
"encounter to either flee or attack you on sight."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Vampiric weakness: vulnerable to fire"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Vampiric weakness: vulnerable to fire"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Fire damages you far more than it should.  You take massive damage from fire "
"and flames, mundane and magical."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Vampiric weakness: cold as a corpse"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Vampiric weakness: cold as a corpse"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You now lack amy body heat.  You feel colder at all times, and being cold "
"will slow you down."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Vampiric weakness: living-drinker"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Vampiric weakness: living-drinker"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You now need to drink some fresh, warm blood from a living being once in a "
"while or suffer growing penalties.  You better find someone willing to share "
"their blood, as blood from fresh corpses won't satisfy this need."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Vampiric weakness: picky feeding"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Vampiric weakness: picky feeding"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your ability to process varied types of blood is now hampered.  Blood that "
"isn't regular human blood will only sate your thirst half as much."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Vampiric weakness: blood cravings"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Vampiric weakness: blood cravings"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your thirst for blood will occasionally magnify, causing painful cravings.  "
"You can calm these cravings as or before they happen by consuming blood."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Vampiric weakness: barred from mortal joys"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Vampiric weakness: barred from mortal joys"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Blood is the only thing that can bring a smile to your lips.  Nothing else "
"gives you any lasting joy or pleasure.  It is impossible for you to be truly "
"happy unless you recently consumed blood."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Vampiric Anathema"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Through the consumption of self-cannibalizing vampire blood, you gained the "
"ability to consume vampire blood to gain vampiric abilities undreamt of by "
"other vampires."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Inner Vault of Blood"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Inner Vault of Blood"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your vestigial circulatory system is now better at holding stolen blood.  You"
" can hold five more liters inside you."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Eternally-Gleaming Eyes"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Eternally-Gleaming Eyes"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your ability to see in the dark has expanded.  You no longer need to spend "
"blood to maintain your gleaming eyes."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Claim the Crimson Wine"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Claim the Crimson Wine"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You can now attract the blood within a corpse's veins, extracting it all in a"
" second through a small cut.  In addition, you can create temporary blood "
"containers by spending mana."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Apex Vampire's Sight"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Apex Vampire's Sight"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"In comparison to you, regular vampires are the same as mortals.  You can now "
"detect nearby vampires, your new prey, even through walls."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Unlimited Drinking"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Unlimited Drinking"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your digestive system has warped to repurpose some vestigial parts, making "
"you much better at drinking blood.  Drinking reasonable amounts of blood "
"won't ever stretch your stomach, and you drink blood much faster now."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "See Through Night's Eyes"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "See Through Night's Eyes"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your supernatural senses have expanded.  You can now see anything close to "
"some nocturnal creatures, even if they lack sight."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Sanguine Paradise"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Sanguine Paradise"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Becoming more vampire than vampires are has affected your new palate, making "
"the consumption of blood feel even better than before.  You now enjoy "
"drinking blood so much that enough of it will bolster your resolve for a "
"while."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Dead Silent Strikes"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Dead Silent Strikes"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your lack of movement noise is now encompassing any noise you could do in "
"combat.  All such noises you would've made by attacking in melee are "
"nullified."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Ascended Anathema"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Ascended Anathema"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You drank enough vampire blood to gain access to power the mentors never "
"thought possible.  There is no more limit to how powerful of a vampire you "
"can be."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Inner Sea of Blood"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Inner Sea of Blood"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your new power allows you to store even more stolen blood inside your body.  "
"You can hold another ten liters inside you."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Shrouded by the Shadowed Path"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Darkness is your home, and you can call it to shroud you from others.  When "
"away from the sun, you can become invisible with a constant expense of blood."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Stitched by the Shadowed Path"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Stitched by the Shadowed Path"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Darkness is your new friend, and like a good friend it helps you through hard"
" times.  Passively heal your wounds and reduce your pain while away from the "
"sun."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Boiling Crimson Cauldron"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Boiling Crimson Cauldron"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"The powers of vampires come through their sustenance of blood, and you now "
"know how to use this at your advantage.  You can increase your need for blood"
" to boost your vampiric potency until you decide to stop the effect.  If you "
"do not have enough blood, it will have no effect until you drink more blood."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Boiling Crimson Cauldron Real"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Increases blood potency and drain while the player-visible version is active "
"and has enough blood.  You should never see this."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Immortal's Health"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Immortal's Health"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Being protected against mundane afflictions only is something your flesh has "
"stopped tolerating.  Your condition now protects you from any illness, "
"parasite and poison, no matter how dangerous they are."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Mastery of Forms"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Mastery of Forms"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You are much more attuned to your other forms, and they are now easier to "
"activate than ever.  The cost to activate them is halved."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Second Final Breath"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Second Final Breath"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your instinctive mastery of your mist form has expanded.  You now recover "
"from triggering Last Breath's Mist twice as quickly."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Fueled by the Blood-Drinkers' Blood"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Fueled by the Blood-Drinkers' Blood"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Vampires, mortals, they are all the same for you now.  Drinking vampire blood"
" now gives all the benefits of drinking regular blood, in addition to growing"
" your power."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Knowledge of the Blood"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Knowledge of the Blood"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your own blood now reveals its secrets to you.  Every week, you will gain a "
"new gift of the blood.  It will only give you what researching your blood "
"gifts could give you."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Maximal Mastery of the Mortal Mind"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Maximal Mastery of the Mortal Mind"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your mind-control abilities are much simpler to use now, halving their cost."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Anathema's Weakness: Slain by the Sun"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Anathema's Weakness: Slain by the Sun"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Vampires burn under the sun, and becoming more of a vampire made you burn far"
" more than any other vampire would.  While under the sun, you will take "
"constant damage no matter how covered you are."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Anathema's Weakness: Blood-Muddled Mind"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Anathema's Weakness: Blood-Muddled Mind"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your constant consumption of vampire blood has permanently destabilized your "
"mind, and it will only grow worse with each new vampire drained.  Each time "
"you drink vampire blood, you have a growing chance to gain a new mental "
"affliction."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Anathema's Weakness: Apex's Thirst"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Anathema's Weakness: Apex's Thirst"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Drinking all this vampire blood has left your body yearning for more.  Going "
"too long without drinking vampire blood will progressively increase your "
"thirst for blood with each passing day until you starve or drink vampire "
"blood."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Saint's blood"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Saint's blood"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Through a complicated ritual utilizing a saint's relic, you have "
"transubstantiated your own blood with the holy blood of the saints.  It'll "
"prevent you from becoming infected with vampirism while you live, effects "
"postmortem unknown."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Future Sight"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Eater's Sixth Sense"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Eater's Sixth Sense"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You are no longer limited to the five senses common to most humans in your "
"hunt for the unnatural."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Fae Authority"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Fae Authority"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Boann bestowed upon you the right to summon a few daffodil warriors once a "
"day."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Fae Enmity"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Fae Enmity"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"The Fair Folk can sense the stolen power within you and their vengeance will "
"be terrible."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "False Arvore"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "False Arvore"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"The arvore can sense the stolen power within you and they will not react well"
" to it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "False Homullus"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "False Homullus"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"The homullus can sense the stolen power within you and they will not react "
"well to it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "False Salamander"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "False Salamander"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"The salamanders can sense the stolen power within you and they will not react"
" well to it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Unknowing Changeling, Noble (Species)"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "Unknowing Changeling, Noble (Species)" for male
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You grew up thinking you were human, just another person among billions, but "
"you were born Under the Hill and swapped for a human baby shortly after "
"birth.  Your parents were the nobility of the Fair Folk, the great lords and "
"ladies who traveled in spider-silk carriages on roads built of moonbeams and "
"danced the unending nights away before leading fantastic armies in battle the"
" next morning.  When the Cataclysm hit, your parents' slumbering power "
"asserted itself, giving you access to a portion of their fae magick.  "
"Hopefully it will help you survive."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Unknowing Changeling, Noble (Species)"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "Unknowing Changeling, Noble (Species)" for
#. female
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You grew up thinking you were human, just another person among billions, but "
"you were born Under the Hill and swapped for a human baby shortly after "
"birth.  Your parents were the nobility of the Fair Folk, the great lords and "
"ladies who traveled in spider-silk carriages on roads built of moonbeams and "
"danced the unending nights away before leading fantastic armies in battle the"
" next morning.  When the Cataclysm hit, your parents' slumbering power "
"asserted itself, giving you access to a portion of their fae magick.  "
"Hopefully it will help you survive."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Unknowing Changeling, Commoner (Species)"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "Unknowing Changeling, Commoner (Species)" for
#. male
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You grew up thinking you were human, just another person among billions, but "
"you were born Under the Hill and swapped for a human baby shortly after "
"birth.  Your parents come from the common masses of the Fair Folk, the pooka,"
" redcaps, hobgoblins, trow, pixies, knockers, selkies, or any of the myriad "
"of others.  When the Cataclysm hit, your parents' slumbering power asserted "
"itself, revealing your heritage and giving you access to a portion of their "
"fae magick.  Hopefully it will help you survive."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Unknowing Changeling, Commoner (Species)"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "Unknowing Changeling, Commoner (Species)" for
#. female
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You grew up thinking you were human, just another person among billions, but "
"you were born Under the Hill and swapped for a human baby shortly after "
"birth.  Your parents come from the common masses of the Fair Folk, the pooka,"
" redcaps, hobgoblins, trow, pixies, knockers, selkies, or any of the myriad "
"of others.  When the Cataclysm hit, your parents' slumbering power asserted "
"itself, revealing your heritage and giving you access to a portion of their "
"fae magick.  Hopefully it will help you survive."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Noble"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid ""
"You have awakened your long-slumbering heritage as one of the nobility of the"
" Fair Folk."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid "Commoner Changeling"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Commoner Changeling"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid ""
"This tracks your heritage, used to pick a subcategory.  You shouldn't see it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid "Summer Court"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Summer Court"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid ""
"You are a member of the Summer Court, sometimes called the Seelie Court, the "
"faeries recognized as benevolent by mortals.  Or, at least, the faeries who "
"are slightly less likely to levy a generational curses on those who wrong "
"them."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid "Winter Court"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Winter Court"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid ""
"You are a member of the Winter Court, sometimes called the Unseelie Court, "
"the faeries most feared by mortals.  Too bad there's so few of them around "
"nowadays."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid "Glamour"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Glamour"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid ""
"This provides the school trait for Changeling magic.  It should not be "
"visible."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Spring"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid ""
"This provides the school trait for Spring seasonal magic.  It should not be "
"visible."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Summer"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid ""
"This provides the school trait for Summer seasonal magic.  It should not be "
"visible."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Autumn"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid ""
"This provides the school trait for Autumn seasonal magic.  It should not be "
"visible."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Winter"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid ""
"This provides the school trait for Winter seasonal magic.  It should not be "
"visible."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid "Changeling"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Changeling"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid ""
"You grew up thinking you were human, just another person among billions, but "
"you were born Under the Hill and swapped for a human baby shortly after "
"birth.  While you find it uncomfortable ever since your heritage asserted "
"itself, your time in the mortal realm has inured you to the presence of iron."
"  However, it has not done so enough to allow you to install any CBMs."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Brownie"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid ""
"You have awakened your long-slumbering heritage as a brownie, hard-working "
"and mostly unseen."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Pooka"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid ""
"You have awakened your long-slumbering heritage as a pooka, a shapeshifter "
"close to nature."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Selkie"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid ""
"You have awakened your long-slumbering heritage as a selkie, with one foot on"
" the land and one in the sea."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Trow"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid ""
"You have awakened your long-slumbering heritage as a trow, strong and "
"enduring as the mountains."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ Name of spell "changeling_noble_cure_bad_conditions_spell"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/changeling_spells.json
msgid "Lights of Imbolc"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Lights of Imbolc"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid ""
"The end of winter brings hope for the coming of spring, and in the light of "
"the candles lit at Imbolc the dust and gloom of the long nights end."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Fires of Bealtaine"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid ""
"The bonfires of Bealtaine drive away evil and purify both man and beast."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Deeds of Lughnasadh"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid ""
"Lughnasadh is a time for bringing in the harvest and for contests of skill "
"and stamina."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ Name of spell "changeling_noble_summon_ghosts_spell"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/changeling_spells.json
msgid "Hosts of Samhain"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Hosts of Samhain"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid ""
"As the year dies and winter's winds begin to blow, the dead return for a "
"short time to visit the living."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid "Right of Passage"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Right of Passage"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid ""
"The Fair Folk have dealt with many mortal civilizations over the aeons, and "
"have come to mutually beneficial arrangements with some of them.  Activate "
"this trait to make your fae nature obvious, invoking those ancient "
"agreements.  This <color_yellow>may anger</color> some who have especially "
"bad relationships with the fae."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ A reference to the A.E. poem 'A Call of the Sidhe'
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid "Murmurs the Mighty One"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Murmurs the Mighty One"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid ""
"You are strong enough to defend a crossroads at twilight against all comers."
"  +3 Strength."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ A reference to the Rose Fyleman poem 'Alms in Autumn'
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid "All Dancing with Delight"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "All Dancing with Delight"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid ""
"You are graceful enough to dance the night away beneath a crystal dome on a "
"floor of mirror-bright silver.  +3 Dexterity."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ A reference to the Lord Dunsany poem 'The Fairy Child'
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid "At Speed Unthought Of"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "At Speed Unthought Of"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid "Your reactions are inhumanly quick.  +15 Speed."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid "Wisdom from the Well"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Wisdom from the Well"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid ""
"Like the legendary salmon who ate the nine acorns, you have gained a plethora"
" of wisdom.  +3 Intelligence."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ A reference to the Charlotte Mew poem 'The Changeling'
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid "Hear the Whole World Whispering"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Hear the Whole World Whispering"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid ""
"You senses are far more attuned to your surroundings than previously.  +3 "
"Perception."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid "Dreamwalker"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Dreamwalker"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid ""
"From the dreams of mortals, you can spin remnants of fantasy into material "
"substance.  When you sleep near mortals, you have a chance to awaken with "
"some dreamdross nearby."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ Name of spell "changeling_noble_command_commoners_spell"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/changeling_spells.json
msgid "Sovereign's Command"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Sovereign's Command"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid ""
"Invoke your rights as one of noble birth and exert your authority over the "
"commoner fae, forcing them to obey your commands.  The glamour will only last"
" a short time, and the target is under no obligation to look on your "
"favorably afterwards."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ A reference to the Yeats poem 'The Stolen Child'
#. ~ Name of spell "changeling_noble_charm_humans_spell"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/changeling_spells.json
msgid "Come Away, O Human Child"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Come Away, O Human Child"
#. ~ Description of mutation "Beguilement"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid ""
"Glamour a human into defending you for a short period of time.  When the "
"glamour ends, all effects end and the human will not be well-disposed toward "
"you afterwards."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ A reference to the Yeats poem 'The Hosting of the Sidhe'
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid "Empty Your Heart of its Mortal Dream"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Empty Your Heart of its Mortal Dream"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid ""
"Your mindset is shifting to the alien morality of those from Under the Hill."
"  You can control this to some extent, though it may also overtake you in "
"times of pain or stress."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid "Household Artistry"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Household Artistry"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid ""
"The brownies are the unassuming crafters of the Fair Folk, and it's easy for "
"you to build and repair things, as long as no one is nearby to watch you do "
"it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid "Adept Household Artistry"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Adept Household Artistry"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid ""
"The brownies are the unassuming crafters of the Fair Folk, and it's very easy"
" for you to build and repair things, as long as no one is nearby to watch you"
" do it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid "Incomparable Household Artistry"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Incomparable Household Artistry"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid ""
"The brownies are the unassuming crafters of the Fair Folk, and it's almost "
"effortless for you to build and repair things, as long as no one is nearby to"
" watch you do it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid "Unobtrusive"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Unobtrusive"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid ""
"Your appearance hasn't changed, but people don't seem to notice you as much "
"as they used to.  As long as you don't engage in combat, you're easy to "
"overlook."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Inconspicuous"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid ""
"Your appearance hasn't changed, but people really don't seem to notice you as"
" much as they used to.  As long as you don't engage in combat, you're very "
"easy to overlook."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Cold Tolerance"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid "The cold doesn't seem to bother you quite as much anymore."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid "Cold Endurance"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Cold Endurance"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid "Even on a winter day, you need only a light jacket now."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid "Inured to Cold"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Inured to Cold"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid ""
"Legends say that brownies went about naked clad only in their almost-furry "
"coat, and while you wouldn't go that far, you could wear a swimsuit in a "
"blizzard without much trouble."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid "Churning As Quick as a Wink"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Churning As Quick as a Wink"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid ""
"Brownies are famous for their ability to do household chores, and you now "
"have an instinctive understanding of making milk and cheese."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid "Coat of Fur"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Coat of Fur"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid ""
"Your hair has thickened to almost the level of fur covering your entire body."
"  It's very warm and provides some level of protection against attacks."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid "Seneschal's Gaze"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Seneschal's Gaze"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid ""
"With a few quick glances you can take in the contents of an entire room.  +3 "
"Perception."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid "Chatelain's Mind"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Chatelain's Mind"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid ""
"It takes a keen mind to keep a household running smoothly.  +2 Intelligence."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid "Homebody"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Homebody"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid ""
"Brownies know every corner of their homes, all the well-worn grooves in the "
"floor and the quick paths from place to place.  Your speed is increased the "
"longer you spend in the same area."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid "Sense Intruders"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Sense Intruders"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid ""
"With the knowledge of one's home comes the knowledge that something is off "
"about it.  You can sense any intruders nearby, as long as you are indoors and"
" have been in the same location for some time."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of creature revealed by special vision "moving_creature"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid "Intruder!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ Name of spell "changeling_brownie_blink_indoors_spell"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/changeling_spells.json
msgid "Slip Through the Cracks"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Slip Through the Cracks"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid ""
"You can tell every nook and cranny of indoor spaces, and know how to quickly "
"get from one place to another."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ Name of spell "changeling_teleport_home_spell"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/changeling_spells.json
msgid "Hurry Home"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Hurry Home"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid "You can return home from anywhere, as quick as a wink."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ Name of spell "changeling_pooka_charm_animals_spell"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/changeling_spells.json
msgid "Friend to Birds and Beasts"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Friend to Birds and Beasts"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid ""
"You are close enough to the birds and beasts that you can speak their "
"language and ask them for aid."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid "Antlers (Shapeshift)"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Antlers (Shapeshift)"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid ""
"Grow an impressive rack of antlers, allowing you to make a headbutt attack "
"but preventing you from wearing a helmet."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid "Curled Horns (Shapeshift)"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Curled Horns (Shapeshift)"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid ""
"Grow a set of spiraling curled horns, allowing you to make a headbutt attack "
"but preventing you from wearing a helmet."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid "Fangs (Shapeshift)"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Fangs (Shapeshift)"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid "Grow a set of sharp fangs, allowing you to make a bite attack."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid "Vicious Fangs (Shapeshift)"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Vicious Fangs (Shapeshift)"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid ""
"Grow a set of long, saber-like fangs, preventing you from wearing mouth gear "
"but allowing you to make rending bite attacks."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid "Wolf Ears (Shapeshift)"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Wolf Ears (Shapeshift)"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid ""
"Change your ears into the ears of a wolf, granting you increased hearing."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid "Feline Ears (Shapeshift)"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Feline Ears (Shapeshift)"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid ""
"Change your ears into the ears of a great cat, granting you increased "
"hearing."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid "Claws (Shapeshift)"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Claws (Shapeshift)"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid ""
"Grow a set of claws, improving your unarmed damage if you aren't wearing "
"gloves."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid "Vicious Claws (Shapeshift)"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Vicious Claws (Shapeshift)"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid ""
"Grow a powerful set of claws, nearly as hard as steel, greatly improving your"
" unarmed damage if you aren't wearing gloves."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid "Bird Wings (Shapeshift)"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Bird Wings (Shapeshift)"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid ""
"Transform your arms into bird wings, allow you to slow your fall when jumping"
" from a high place and glide short distances."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid "Thick Fur (Shapeshift)"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Thick Fur (Shapeshift)"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid ""
"Grow a coat of thick fur, keeping you warm in the winter and protecting you "
"from attacks."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid "Chitin Carapace (Shapeshift)"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Chitin Carapace (Shapeshift)"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid ""
"Grow an armored suit of chitin, protecting you and making your punches hit "
"harder."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid "Quadruped (Shapeshift)"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Quadruped (Shapeshift)"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid ""
"Grow paws and animal-like legs, allowing you to run much faster on all fours,"
" but preventing you from wearing shoes or gloves."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid "Quadruped"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Quadruped"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid ""
"Your arms, hands, and legs are animal-like, allowing you to move quickly when"
" running on all fours, but preventing you from wearing shoes or gloves."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid "Leaping Legs (Shapeshift)"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Leaping Legs (Shapeshift)"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid ""
"Grow strong frog- or cat-like legs, allowing you to leap great distances."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid "Wolf Tail (Shapeshift)"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Wolf Tail (Shapeshift)"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid ""
"Grow the tail of a wolf, making it harder to wear pants but improving your "
"balance."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid "Cat Tail (Shapeshift)"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Cat Tail (Shapeshift)"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid ""
"Grow the tail of a cat, making it harder to wear pants but improving your "
"balance."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid "Spiked Tail (Shapeshift)"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Spiked Tail (Shapeshift)"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid ""
"Grow the tail of a scorpion, making it harder to wear pants but allowing you "
"to attack with the stinger."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid "Bestial Strength"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Bestial Strength"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid ""
"Even when not shapeshifted you can bring part of a wild animal's strength to "
"bear.  +2 Strength."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid "Untamed Agility"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Untamed Agility"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid "You have the quick reactions of a wild animal.  +3 Dexterity."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid "Initiate of Forms"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Initiate of Forms"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid ""
"You are getting better at shapeshifting and are able to maintain one more "
"simultaneous shapeshift without drawing on your mana."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid "Adept of Forms"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Adept of Forms"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid ""
"You are getting much better at shapeshifting and are able to maintain two "
"more simultaneous shapeshifts without drawing on your mana."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid "Master of Forms"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Master of Forms"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid ""
"You are a master of shapeshifting and are able to maintain four more "
"simultaneous shapeshifts without drawing on your mana."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid "Spirit of the Bat"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Spirit of the Bat"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid "You can transform yourself into a bat."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid "Spirit of the Raven"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Spirit of the Raven"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid "You can transform yourself into a raven."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid "Spirit of the Bear"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Spirit of the Bear"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid "You can transform yourself into a bear."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid "Spirit of the Deer"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid "Spirit of the Wolf"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Spirit of the Wolf"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid "You can transform yourself into a wolf."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid "Spirit of the Cougar"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Spirit of the Cougar"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid "You can transform yourself into a cougar."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid "Instinctive Attacks"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Instinctive Attacks"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid ""
"You're getting used to moving and reacting like an animal.  When without "
"weapons or armor and using your gifts of shapeshifting, your natural attacks "
"do more damage."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid "Animalistic Defense"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Animalistic Defense"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid ""
"The best defense is not getting hit, especially if you're a wild animal.  "
"When using your shapeshifting and not wearing armor or using a weapon, you "
"gain a bonus to your dodging."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid "Primal Alacrity"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Primal Alacrity"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid ""
"Like the animals you mimic, you're quicker than you seem.  You gain a speed "
"bonus while shapeshifted as long as you're unarmed and unarmored."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid "Bending Like the River"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Bending Like the River"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid ""
"Your movements are graceful whether on land or in the water.  +3 Dexterity."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid "Eyes On the Waterline"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Eyes On the Waterline"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid "Your sight is keen whether in or out of the water.  +2 Perception."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid "Thoughts like Clear Water"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Thoughts like Clear Water"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid ""
"Your mind flows easily from topic to topic while remembering the important "
"details.  +2 Intelligence."
msgstr ""

